Foral, called Lieutenant Foral, is a goblin of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], small and green-skinned, dressed in layers of tight black leather and cloaks. He carries a rifle taller than he is, an electronic scanner, and cartridges for every purpose. He works alone when he can, from hiding, and picks his shots.

His wife was murdered and the death was ruled an accident. The killer has since come back and taken his daughter, holding her for ransom, and no one will help him because they do not believe the killer returned. Foral takes one last job after another to raise what he needs. His daughter is sick as well, and he carries her cure with him.
